[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4002632854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116383#issuecomment-4002632854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116383","id":4002632854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uk1SW","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T06:38:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T06:38:46Z","body":"I'm not sure I understand why this needs to be in core, given it's not used by any of the engine implementations.\r\n\r\nIf you are using a `MultiplayerPeerExtension` can't you just add the signal to your extension?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4002632854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008804709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116383#issuecomment-4008804709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116383","id":4008804709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u8YFl","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T01:02:08Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T05:12:19Z","body":"@Faless The problem is that I'm not interested in when the extension peer is closed, I'm interested in when a peer implementation of any type which is not set to the current `MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer` is closed, which may happen by itself internally. I guess the alternative is checking the peer in `_process` via a weakref to see if it still exists and is connected, although I tend to avoid hacks like that. (EDIT It's actually pretty ugly doing it this way now that I've tried)\r\n\r\nI'm not sure that the signal not being used by the engine itself means it cannot be included, e.g. `MultiplayerAPI.connected_to_server`.\r\n\r\nBased on the discussion on RocketChat, if it makes it more likely to be included I could make the signal only be emitted when the peer closes itself internally?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008804709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]